		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Leave a trail of grease that trips pursuers.</em></p><p><strong>Free Action.</strong> You leave grease in any spaces you enter this turn. Grease lasts 1 minute or until removed and is Slowed Terrain. Creatures that enter a greased space must succeed a DEX save or fall Prone.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Affects all spaces adjacent to you.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You ignore Slowed Terrain you create.</p><hr><p><em>[M] Gadget activation costs 1 Toolbelt scrap (2 total for the Toolbelt upgrade); the passive is always active. Scrap cost and activation are tracked by the module.</em></p>",
